- 74 (37 female, 37male) participants from different backgrounds were selected and trained on peace building and digital creation and storytelling, including participants from host communities, returnees, IDPs, and nomadic groups. Most of the participants are located inside El Geneina town, representing youth from nine locations namely Um Dowein, Aljabal, Ardamata, Alreyad, Alsafa, Alsafiya, Alshatei, Umelkhura, and Gukory. 
The age category of the participants is ranging from 18 to 34 years old, and most of the youth who were selected as peace ambassadors obtained either a university degree or a higher Sudanese secondary certificate.</narrative>
